  "body": "Currently the spec. uses the term \"initial about:blank document\" in notes, but uses different prose in the normative text such as \"the about:blank Document created when the child browsing context was created\". This makes it more difficult to locate parts of the spec. that refer to the initial about:blank document. It would be helpful if this was a defined term and the spec. used it where appropriate throughout. (Maybe also define a term \"normal about:blank\" or \"non-initial about:blank\"?)\n",
